# Pin line endings explicitly. The .cmd files MUST be CRLF (cmd.exe and its
# goto/label handling), and the .ps1 files are kept LF as tested. Without this,
# a global core.autocrlf would silently rewrite them on checkout.
# 显式固定换行符。.cmd 文件必须是 CRLF（cmd.exe 及其 goto/标签处理），.ps1 文件
# 保持测试时的 LF。若不固定，全局 core.autocrlf 会在检出时悄悄改写它们。
*.ps1  text eol=lf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
.gitignore     text eol=lf
LICENSE        text eol=lf

# Never touch these.
# 这些文件不要做任何转换。
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.gif  binary
